-jinshu-040-wyd1739-jiachong"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu:p005:m0187","start":187,"end":189,"surface":"鄭冲","kind":"person","person_id":"wxk_zk0_zoi","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu:p005","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu:p005:m0191","start":191,"end":193,"surface":"文和","kind":"person","person_id":"wxk_zk0_zoi","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu:p005","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p012","text":"武帝踐阼，拜太保，進爵爲公，加置七官之職。帝新愛命，虛己以求讜言。祥與何曾、鄭沖等耆艾篤老，希復朝見，帝遣侍中任愷諮問得失，及政化所先。祥以年老疲耄，累乞遜位，帝不許。御史中丞侯史光以祥久疾，闕朝會禮，請免祥官。詔曰：「太保元老高行，朕所毗倚以隆政道者也。前後遜讓，不從所執，此非有司所得議也。」遂寢光奏。祥固乞骸骨，詔聽以睢陵公就第，位同保傅，在三司之右，祿賜如前。詔曰：「古之致仕，不事王侯。今雖以國公留居京邑，不宜復苦以朝請。其賜几杖，不朝，大事皆諮訪之。賜安車駟馬，第一區，錢百萬，絹五百匹，床帳簟褥，以舍人六人爲睢陵公舍人，置官騎二十人。以公子騎都尉肇爲給事中，使常優遊定省。又乙太保高潔清素，家無宅宇，其權留本府，須所賜第成乃出。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p012:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"hgm_jvn_hle","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段敘事、稱謂與引語身份辨識；不由同名自動合併。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p012:m0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"太保","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段敘事、稱謂與引語身份辨識；不由同名自動合併。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p012:m0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"hgm_jvn_hle","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段敘事、稱謂與引語身份辨識；不由同名自動合併。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p012:m0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"祥","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段敘事